      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've come across this problem too. This seems to happen to me if I bring up the SteamVR overlay (Sometimes it's fine, sometimes it's not it seems to be very random when this happens).\n\nHowever, I've noticed that sometimes even when not having the SteamVR menu up my FPS just tanks to almost 2-3 from a normal 70 and my GPU/VRAM usage spikes to 100%.\n\nThis also seems to happen when unloading worlds going from a busy world with people to an empty world causes the whole game to hang for 5 minutes then will recover and be fine",
