      "value": "@{5f2d0ed224735547e2995d3a|full_name}: yeah Ive mentioned this as well below as additional notes, its why i now refer to Steam VR bindings as \"crash buttons\" since using any long press form SteamVR buttons result in the entire game just freezing until I close it, only way i can use the dashboard is to quickly empty Vram by either leaving the world to one that is less populated or leave the area until LOD kicks in, this is present in both old and new steamvr dash 1.0 and 2.0, aswell as live and beta vrc, even more so after 2022 was pushed to live.",
